      "simplified": "保罗说：“我坐火车都不敢买上铺，因为我恐高上不去。”",
      "traditional": "保羅說：“我坐火車都不敢買上鋪，因為我恐高上不去。”",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shuō wǒ zuò huǒ chē dōu bù gǎn mǎi shàng pù yīn wèi wǒ kǒng gāo shàng bú qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul said: “I don’t even dare to buy upper bunk when I go on a train, because I can’t get up on it for fear of heights.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "露西说：“你看，我都不敢穿高跟鞋，高一点我就头晕。”",
