      "Ben’s Diary – Fear of Heights",
      "",
      "July 18, 2019 Clear weather",
      "",
      "Today, my friends and I went to a theme park together.",
      "I wanted to enjoy bungee jumping, but everyone said that they were afraid of heights, and couldn’t play that.",
      "",
      "Paul said: “I don’t even dare to buy upper bunk when I go on a train, because I can’t get up on it for fear of heights.”",
      "",
      "Lucy said: “Look, I don’t even dare to wear high-heeled shoes, I’ll get dizzy if I’m a bit taller.”",
      "",
      "Finally, Zhang Ming said: “My dad’s family name is Gao, and because I’m afraid of heights, I don’t even dare being named Gao.”",
      "“I have no other choice but to take my mom’s family name.”",
      "",
      "To be frank, they’re just cowards!",
